[version]
1.5.0
[date]
2026-10-21
[whatsnew]
SECURITY FIX: Login no longer auto-accepts empty password
  - checkPassword() now returns false for empty hash (was returning true!)
  - login.lua forces password setup on first boot if root has no password
  - Can no longer log in as root without authentication
NEW: Full window manager with colored borders
  - Each window gets a unique border color (8 colors cycle)
  - Title bar with [_] minimize  [maximize]  [X] close buttons
  - Click title bar to drag and move window
  - Drag bottom-right corner (>) to resize window
  - Click window to bring to front (z-order)
NEW: Taskbar at bottom of screen
  - Shows minimized windows as clickable buttons
  - Click a minimized window button to restore it
  - Shows count of open windows
NEW: Printer support (usr/bin/print.lua)
  - Print text files to attached Printer block
  - 'print <file>' to print
  - 'print --list' to see printers
  - 'print --status' for paper/ink levels
  - 'print <file> --title "Title"' for titled pages
  - Auto-paginates long files
IMPROVED: Mouse interactions
  - All window operations are mouse-driven (no keyboard needed)
  - Click icons to launch, click windows to focus
  - Click taskbar to restore minimized apps
  - Drag title bar to move, drag corner to resize
FIX: Top menu bar menus now open reliably
  - Click "ArchOS" / "Apps" / "System" to open dropdown
  - Click a menu item to execute
  - Click elsewhere to close
[/whatsnew]
[files]
de/gui.lua
bin/login.lua
lib/users.lua
usr/bin/print.lua
etc/apps.conf
installer.lua
latest_update.upd
[/files]
